  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal model using the resnet50 image encoder and weighted fusion without aggregation, isolating its impact compared to prior multimodal baselines. Validation accuracy of 0.5399 is lower than the prior multimodal baseline (config_007) using imagenet_vit_l and transformer aggregation, suggesting potential limitations in the image encoder or aggregation method. The exact contribution of resnet50 versus imagenet_vit_l or the absence of aggregation remains uncertain due to lack of isolated comparison."
}

